---
type:      "job"
name:      "skypartition"
interface: "python"
script:    "main.py"
comment:   >
  SkyMEMBOOST Auto-Partition — detects hardware (RAM, DDR gen, PCIe NVMe gen),
  calculates optimal GPT partition layout, creates all partitions, formats them,
  creates ZFS pool skyvault on vault partition (all remaining space), and
  initializes the SKYRESTORE recovery partition with module manifest.
  User selects disk only — all sizing is automatic and repeatable.
